under \eqn{H_0}, \eqn{\mathrm{ER}_k \sim \chi^2_1} (Golan 2008, Sec.
6.4/6.6). An overall ER test of \eqn{H_0\!:} all coefficients (intercept
and slopes) \eqn{= 0} is also reported. Note this performs \eqn{K+1}
warm-started refits.

